+/// The production MachInst path is intentionally a verified hybrid selector.
+///
+/// The historical experimental mode attempted to lower memory, CFG, copies and
+/// calls into a buffer without a complete independent allocator.  That crossed
+/// representation boundaries (stack homes, phi copies, flag state) and produced
+/// wrong code.  The safe subset below contains only pure GPR integer operations
+/// whose inputs and destination already have physical assignments from the
+/// proven global allocator; no unresolved virtual register, memory address,
+/// call-clobber, or control-flow state can enter the MachInst buffer.
